# Verification before declaring completion

- Start from a clear change scope and acceptance criteria.
- Run lint, TypeScript checks, unit tests and production build for meaningful changes when execution is possible.
- Test actual booking and checkout flows in sandbox/test mode, including errors, duplicate requests, cancellations and webhook retries.
- Verify public-facing changes in a browser at mobile and desktop widths.
- Record which commands and scenarios passed, failed, or could not be executed. Never invent verification.
- Existing Squarespace pages and payments remain operational until content comparison, transaction reconciliation and explicit go-live approval.
